{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"6":"Chapters Regarding Funerals"},"section_detail":{"6":{"hadithnumber_first":1433,"hadithnumber_last":1637,"arabicnumber_first":1433,"arabicnumber_last":1637,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1592,"arabicnumber":1592,"text":"حدثنا هشام بن عمار، حدثنا سفيان، عن ابراهيم الهجري، عن ابن ابي اوفى، قال نهى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم عن المراثي","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":6,"hadith":160}}]}